---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Pattern from '../../components/Pattern.astro';
import ProductCard from '../../components/ProductCard.astro';
import GuideCard from '../../components/GuideCard.astro';
import Disclosure from '../../components/Disclosure.astro';
import {products} from '../../lib/catalog';
import {pagePath} from '../../config/site';
const guides=(await getCollection('guides',({data})=>data.publishStatus==='published')).slice(0,4);
const featured=[products[0],products[1],products[3]].filter(Boolean);
---
<Base title="Japanese craft, worn your way"><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-square"></span> THE CRAFT EDIT · NO. 01</p><h1>Japanese craft,<br/><em>worn your way.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">Thoughtful little objects. Remarkable making.<br/>Discover Japanese craft accessories and the stories behind them — starting in Kanagawa.</p><a class="button" href={pagePath('objects/')}>Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="hero-secondary" href={pagePath('journal/everyday-craft-earrings/')}>New to craft accessories? Start here <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><div class="hero-footnote"><span>01 / KANAGAWA</span><span>Wood. Pattern. Possibility.</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><Pattern hero/><div class="visual-stamp"><span>THE BEAUTY<br/>IS IN THE</span><em>details.</em></div></div></section>
<div class="wrap intro-line"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LESS GUESSWORK</span><p>Know the maker. Understand the details.<br/>Choose something that feels like you.</p></div>
<section class="wrap browse-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Find your kind of object.</h2><a class="text-link" href={pagePath('objects/')}>View all objects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="type-links"><a href={pagePath('objects/?type=pierced-earrings')}><span class="type-icon" aria-hidden="true">◌</span><span>Pierced earrings<small>A small detail, a different perspective</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={pagePath('objects/?type=clip-on-earrings')}><span class="type-icon" aria-hidden="true">⊂</span><span>Non-pierced earrings<small>Begin with the right fastening</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={pagePath('objects/?type=necklace')}><span class="type-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><span>Beyond earrings<small>Explore a yosegi pendant</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE FIRST SELECTION</p><h2>A closer look at yosegi.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={pagePath('objects/')}>Explore all {products.length} objects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="section-intro">Geometric woodwork, translated into everyday accessories. These are researched introductions, with the details we could verify and the questions still worth asking.</p><Disclosure productIds={featured.map(p=>p.id)}/><div class="product-grid">{featured.map((p,i)=><ProductCard product={p} index={i}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="place-feature"><div class="wrap place-grid"><div class="place-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><span class="mountain mountain-one"></span><span class="mountain mountain-two"></span><span class="place-sun"></span><span class="place-coordinates">KANAGAWA<br/>神奈川</span></div><div class="place-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PLACES & PEOPLE / 01</p><h2>A beginning<br/>in <em>Kanagawa.</em></h2><p>In Hakone, wood becomes pattern. Our first regional edit follows yosegi from its workshop context to the small objects you can wear.</p><p class="place-small">We distinguish where a maker works from where an individual object was made. A shop address is only part of the story.</p><a class="button button-light" href={pagePath('places/kanagawa/')}>Meet the first region <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE JOURNAL</p><h2>A little knowledge goes a long way.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={pagePath('journal/')}>All field notes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="guide-grid">{guides.map((g,i)=><GuideCard guide={g} index={i}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="wrap trust-strip"><p class="eyebrow">OUR EDITORIAL PROMISE</p><h2>Curiosity, with the sources to match.</h2><div class="trust-grid"><p><strong>Facts you can trace.</strong> Primary sources and a checked date accompany every object.</p><p><strong>Room for the unknown.</strong> No invented weights, wear tests, reviews or promises.</p><p><strong>A clear way onwards.</strong> We guide you to the retailer, who handles the purchase.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={pagePath('editorial-policy/')}>Read our approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section></Base>